Package: usbdeskbar
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: USB device list tray item for V\OS
 USBDeskbar shows a Deskbar tray item that lists connected USB devices
 in a popup menu; selecting one opens an information window with ids,
 class codes and the active configuration's interfaces and endpoints.
 .
 This build shows only the active configuration; class-specific raw
 descriptors are not listed.
